                <div class="col-lg-4 py-0 py-lg-5">
                    <h1 class="mb-3">Our Story</h1>
                    <h5 class="mb-3">The Waste Food Management System (WFMS) is a digital platform built to reduce food wastage and hunger by connecting food donors—such as restaurants, caterers, households, and supermarkets—with NGOs, shelters, and people in need. Through this system, we aim to create a seamless channel where surplus edible food can be identified, registered, and distributed efficiently in real time.</h5>
                </div>
