                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-lg-4 py-0 py-lg-5">
                    <h1 class="mb-3">Our Vision</h1>
                    <p>Our mission is to combat food waste and alleviate hunger through innovation, collaboration, and compassion. Every meal saved through WFMS not only nourishes someone in need but also contributes to reducing the environmental footprint caused by discarded food.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
